E (10010) task_wdt: CPU 0: loopTask
E (10010) task_wdt: CPU 1: IDLE
E (10010) task_wdt: Aborting.
abort() was called at PC 0x400e16b4 on core 0
Backtrace: 0x400811e5:0x3ffb21c0 0x40085a61:0x3ffb21e0 0x40089e22:0x3ffb2200
